### Count jokes - expect 200 and an object with count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jokes/count
Accept: application/json

### Read jokes - expect 200 and an array
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jokes/15
Accept: application/json

### Update a single joke likes- expect 200 and an array
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jokes/like/15
Accept: application/json

### Update a single joke jeers- expect 200 and an array
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jokes/jeer/15
Accept: application/json
